    zh
      ? "首尔 PCS／ISR／TEC／OPT 条件性 60，LON 条件性 40；GSS／RES／MED 未定，无总分中心、数学域 34—74。真实保护、福利衔接、研究转移、数字辅助和交通支持有限能力。两院已治疗与安全监测是重要正向证据；候补、容量下降、等待延长、转诊受限及非报销费用／安全劳动的组合支持长寿居民链的明显约束。40 仍依赖疾病路径代表性、费用重要性、2025→2026 延续和范围适用，拒绝则未知；新证据证明费用可承担且主要瓶颈缓解，再审 60，域 36—76。撤回 LON 为 30—80，均不证明入围或排除。自主循环恢复不当出院生存，单药断点不降低全部医疗。九月机场表截止前公开未核清，未用于评分；七个近似点不验证完整地域或治疗地点。"
      : "Seoul has conditional 60 judgments for PCS, ISR, TEC and OPT, and 40 for LON. GSS, RES and MED remain unknown, without a total centre and with a mathematical domain of 34–74. Delivered protection, welfare connections, research transfer, digital assistance and transport support scoped capability. Actual treatment and safety monitoring at two providers are important positive evidence; waitlisting, reduced start capacity, longer waits, limited transfers and reported nonreimbursed costs and safety labour together support a material resident-access discontinuity. LON 40 still requires pathway-relevance, cost-materiality, 2025-to-2026 continuity and scope assumptions; rejection restores unknown. New evidence of affordable costs and substantive bottleneck mitigation would support reviewing 60, giving 36–76. Withdrawing LON gives 30–80; neither establishes qualification or exclusion. Return of spontaneous circulation is not discharge survival, and a single-drug bottleneck does not downgrade general medicine. September airport statistics have unverified pre-cutoff publication and are unused; seven approximate points verify neither whole boundaries nor treatment sites.",
  ],
  [lisbon.candidateId]: [
    zh
      ? "里斯本 ISR／TEC／OPT 条件性 60、MED 条件性 40；PCS／GSS／RES／LON 未定，无中心、数学域 27—77。医疗低档依据多机构实际首诊超时、等待库存与家庭医生缺口，与已发生接诊、转移及下沉服务一起判读；已治疗者与等待者分母不混用。质量编码未闭与原表／文字冲突保留，不直接当稳定死亡结局。LON 有首批给药正向声明，但产品、支付、监测和普通居民费用未连通；截止后更新的支付查询不回填，更不由未知取低档。供水储备保住多数用户，同时保留局部限制和年度中断；摘要不等于所有住户零中断。停车数字支付的 74% 是收入份额，不是居民率；谈判许可不算已执行。判断依赖范围、延续与缓解后仍重要，拒绝则未知。撤回 MED 为 21—86，新依据支持 MED 60 才为 30—80，均不证明入围或排除。"
      : "Lisbon has conditional 60 judgments for ISR, TEC and OPT, and 40 for MED. PCS, GSS, RES and LON remain unknown, without a centre and with a mathematical domain of 27–77. MED combines actual late first consultations at multiple providers, waiting stocks and family-doctor gaps with delivered care, transfers and primary-care mitigation; completed and waiting cohorts have different denominators. Unclosed quality coding and table/prose conflicts remain, without being treated as stable mortality outcomes. An actual first-treatment statement supports LON capability, but product, payments, monitoring and ordinary resident costs are not connected. A payment query updated after the cutoff is not backfilled, and unknowns do not receive low scores. Water reserves served most customers, with local restrictions and annual interruptions retained; summaries do not prove uninterrupted service to every household. Digital parking payments account for 74% of revenue, not residents, and negotiated licences are not executed licences. Judgments require scope, continuity and material constraints after mitigation; rejection restores unknown. Withdrawing MED gives 21–86; new evidence supporting MED 60 would give 30–80. Neither establishes qualification or exclusion.",
  ],
  [chicago.candidateId]: [
    zh
      ? "芝加哥功能区 PCS／RES 条件性 40，ISR／LON／TEC／OPT 条件性 60；GSS／MED 未定，无中心、数学域 37—67。跨州范围保留 Gary 等地实际长断电与资源损失，也保留已经完成的恢复和援助；启动监管调查不等于责任已认定。水务通知缺口与补发整改共同判读，数字旧数重刊与客流方法重述不当新实绩。LON 依据人体／监管和实际当地采用，仍依赖监测、医保负担与延续假设；不因此给整维 MED 补分。必要假设拒绝则未知，现有部分域不证明入围或排除。"
      : "Chicago has conditional 40 judgments for PCS and RES, and 60 for ISR, LON, TEC and OPT. GSS and MED remain unresolved, without a centre and with a mathematical domain of 37–67. The cross-state FUA retains actual prolonged outages and resource losses around Gary alongside completed restoration and relief. A regulatory investigation is not a liability finding. Water-notification failures and correction are read together; reprinted digital figures and restated transit counts are not new measurements or growth. LON combines human/regulatory evidence and actual local adoption, with reversible monitoring, insurance affordability and continuity assumptions. It does not fill MED. Rejecting necessary assumptions restores unknown; the partial domain establishes neither qualification nor exclusion.",
  ],
  [prague.candidateId]: [
    zh
      ? "布拉格八维完整条件中心62：TEC80，其余七维60。新增实际洪水保护／适应项目、安全观察、资源备用与住户负担、医疗安全运行；旧等待、限收、停电共因和费用约束均保留。国家安全观察和行政住户样本不是功能区实测。通常保护、居民获得／负担、有限替代、地域及延续均为可撤回假设；29项partial、1项context、1项unresolved不等充分测量。任一15%维撤回即无中心、域53—68。"
      : "Prague has a complete conditional centre of 62: TEC 80 and the other seven dimensions60. Actual flood protection/adaptation, security observations, resource alternatives/household affordability and medical safety operations supplement the evidence. Long waits, intake limits, shared power failures and costs remain. National security observations and administrative household samples are not FUA measurements. Usual protection/access/affordability, limited alternatives, scope and continuation are reversible assumptions;29partial,1context and1unresolved subpillars are not full measurement. Withdrawing any15% dimension removes the centre and gives53–68.",
  ],
  [beijing.candidateId]: [
    zh
      ? "北京功能区六维条件性 60、TEC 80、OPT 40，条件中心 60。多主体实际转化、数字使用及辅助交付支持技术高档；资本用途／定居顺序限制与实际跨境通信约束，结合强交通和合法支付缓解，支持 OPT 的重要约束判断。资料记录数只用于全量候选的研究顺序，不用于评分或入围。"
      : "Beijing has six conditional 60 judgments, TEC 80 and OPT 40, giving a conditional centre of 60. Multiple institutions' actual transfers, digital use and assisted delivery support the high TEC anchor. Capital-purpose and settlement-order constraints plus measured cross-border restrictions are read alongside strong transport and lawful payments for OPT. Directory record counts determine research sequence only, never scores or qualification.",
    zh
      ? "密云／怀柔和太师屯参考点不属本区，外围死伤不填本地损失率。医疗过程短板和旧治疗经济延迟仍保留；原论文为 42 给药／29 半年、ARIA 3/42、调整后组间认知差异未显著，后续新闻队列不混用。自愿普惠险不等于通常基本医保，单次报销报道不证明中位居民完整负担。拒绝任何必要范围、居民、持续性或重要性假设即撤回该维与总分中心，不证明全球入围。"
      : "Miyun, Huairou and Taishitun reference points are outside this FUA; peripheral casualties are not local loss rates. Clinical-process gaps and earlier economic treatment delays remain. The original paper has 42 treated, 29 six-month patients, 3 ARIA cases and no significant adjusted between-group cognitive result; later news cohorts stay separate. Voluntary supplementary cover is not usual basic insurance, and one reimbursement report does not establish complete median-resident costs. Rejecting any necessary scope, resident, continuity or materiality assumption withdraws that dimension and the total centre. Global qualification remains unproven.",
  ],
  [shanghai.candidateId]: [
    zh
      ? "上海功能区五维条件性 60、LON／OPT 40、TEC 80，条件中心 58。多机构实际转化、网办使用及完成助老支持技术高档；真实内涝／供水故障、护理质控缺陷与实际保护、常规服务和恢复共同判读。崇明和昆山参考点属其他候选，市域总量不填本区居民率；目录关联仅用于全量研究顺序。"
      : "Shanghai has five conditional 60 judgments, LON and OPT 40, and TEC 80, giving a conditional centre of 58. Multiple producers, actual digital use and completed assistance support the high TEC anchor. Flooding, water-system failure and nursing-process gaps are read alongside operating protection, routine care and recovery. Chongming and Kunshan references belong to other candidates; municipal totals are not local resident rates. Directory associations determine research sequence only.",
    zh
      ? "LON 40 保留真实给药、监护和日间减负，也保留经济／交通退出与当前住院责任不自动覆盖不足 24 小时路径的错位；有实际可承担门诊或医学合理住院支付支持，可审 60。407 人是七院队列，ARIA 为 39/321、症状 4/321，15 人混合主观退出不全是经济原因；无对照认知变化不证明疗效或延寿。任何必要居民、范围、延续或残余重要性假设拒绝即撤回该维与中心，不证明全球入围。"
      : "LON 40 retains real treatment, monitoring and reduced day-care burden alongside economic/transport withdrawals and the mismatch between the observed under-24-hour pathway and current inpatient cover. Supported affordable outpatient or clinically appropriate covered inpatient alternatives could justify 60. The 407 patients span seven hospitals; ARIA is 39/321 and symptomatic ARIA 4/321. Fifteen mixed subjective withdrawals are not all financial. Uncontrolled cognitive changes prove neither efficacy nor longer life. Rejecting a necessary resident, scope, continuity or residual-materiality assumption withdraws that dimension and the centre; global qualification remains unproven.",
  ],
};
