<section id="global-research" class="cci-section" aria-labelledby="global-research-title">
  <div class="cci-section-heading">
    <h2 id="global-research-title">
      {zh ? "全球 Top 32 研究进展" : "Global Top 32 research progress"}
    </h2>
    <p class="research-date">
      {zh ? "研究更新" : "Research update"} · <time datetime="2026-10-15">2026-10-15</time>
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="research-overview">
    <div>
      <p class="research-conclusion">
        {
          zh
            ? "全球 Top 32 尚未确定。现有案例用于校准评分规则，入围结论仍需验证其他候选。"
            : "A global Top 32 has not been established. Current cases calibrate the scoring rules; inclusion still needs to be tested against other candidates."
        }
      </p>
      <p class="research-note">
        {
          zh
            ? `本区独立于上方历史发布。候选范围为 ${n(coverage.candidateCount)} 个功能城市区；条件性案例和局部证据关联均不表示已取得全球排名资格。`
            : `Separate from the historical release above. The scope includes ${n(coverage.candidateCount)} functional urban areas; conditional cases and partial evidence links do not establish global ranking eligibility.`
        }
      </p>
      <p class="research-note">
        {
          zh
            ? "优先评估已有多维能力依据、补证可能改变判断的候选，最多三个研究任务并行，主任务统一验收口径。每批公布分数、未知项和敏感性；两轮定向补查后交接，未知保留。研究优先级不预设CCI名次，持续核查未评估竞争者。"
            : "Prioritise candidates with substantive evidence across dimensions where further review could change a judgment. At most three research tasks run concurrently, with central review against the same scoring rules. Each batch reports scores, unknowns and sensitivity; hand off after two targeted rounds. Priority does not predetermine CCI rank, and unassessed competitors remain under review."
        }
        <a
          href="https://github.com/realmorrisliu/realmorrisliu.com/blob/main/docs/cci-research-priority.md"
        >
          {zh ? "研究优先级与批次结果" : "Research priority and batch results"}
        </a>
        {" · "}<a
          href="https://github.com/realmorrisliu/realmorrisliu.com/blob/main/docs/cci-unassessed-priority-screening.md"
          >{zh ? "冻结筛查演算" : "Frozen screening calculations"}</a
        >
      </p>
    </div>
    <dl class="research-progress" aria-label={zh ? "评分研究进度" : "Scoring research progress"}>
      <div>
        <dt>{zh ? "已审阅案例" : "Cases reviewed"}</dt>
        <dd>
          {n(cases.length)}{
            zh ? " 份有界审阅 · 31 项覆盖记录" : " bounded reviews · 31 scope records"
          }
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>{zh ? "条件性评分" : "Conditional assessments"}</dt>
        <dd>
          {
            zh
              ? `${n(screening.completeConditionalCaseCount)} 份完整 · ${n(screening.partialCaseCount)} 份部分判断`
              : `${n(screening.completeConditionalCaseCount)} complete · ${n(screening.partialCaseCount)} partial`
          }
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>{zh ? "待审阅候选" : "Candidates awaiting review"}</dt>
        <dd>
          {n(screening.unassessedCount)}{
            zh ? " 个 · 尚无此类八维审阅" : " · No such eight-dimension review"
          }
        </dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </div>
  <nav class="research-nav" aria-label={zh ? "研究进展导航" : "Research progress navigation"}>
    <a href="#local-calibration">{zh ? "评分案例" : "Scorecards"}</a>
    <a href="#case-reviews">{zh ? "判读依据" : "Case evidence"}</a>
    <a href="#research-boundaries">{zh ? "候选边界" : "Candidate boundaries"}</a>
    <a href="#publication-scope">{zh ? "出榜条件" : "Publication scope"}</a>
  </nav>
  <div id="local-calibration">
    <h3>{zh ? "当地居民评分校准" : "Local-resident scoring calibration"}</h3>
    <dl class="research-profile">
      <div>
        <dt>{zh ? "评价对象" : "Resident profile"}</dt>
        <dd>
          {
            zh
              ? "本国公民，通常长期居住，当地中位收入和通常医保。"
              : "Local citizens who usually reside in the city, at median local income and with usual healthcare coverage."
          }
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>{zh ? "评价时点" : "Assessment period"}</dt>
        <dd>
          {
            zh
              ? "2026 年 · 证据截止 2026-10-10；后续复核另记实际查阅日期。"
              : "2026 · Evidence cutoff: 10 October 2026. Subsequent checks record actual retrieval dates."
          }
        </dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
    <p class="research-note">
      {
        zh
          ? "评分依赖明确假设，不表示每项均有充分测量。“—”表示未定，不能填零或生成总分。"
          : "Scores depend on explicit assumptions, not complete measurements. “—” means unresolved, with no zero imputation or total centre."
      }
    </p>
    <div
      class="cci-table-scroll research-table"
      tabindex="0"
      aria-label={zh ? "条件性评分案例" : "Conditional scoring cases"}
      aria-describedby="research-table-hint"
    >
      <table>
        <caption>
          <strong
            >{
              zh
                ? "条件性成绩单 · 用于校准，不是排名"
                : "Conditional scorecards · calibration, not a ranking"
            }</strong
          >
          <span id="research-table-hint">
            {
              zh
                ? "表内可上下、横向滚动；点击城市查看依据。"
                : "Scroll vertically or sideways; select a city for its evidence."
            }
          </span>
        </caption>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th scope="col">{zh ? "城市／功能区" : "City / functional area"}</th>
            {
              DIMENSIONS.map(dimension => (
                <th scope="col">
                  <abbr title={cciCopy[currentLang].dimensions[dimension.id].name}>
